From 529db50550a8737d074c24a7bb3f0c0bfd7aedfd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mrinohk <5554998+Mrinohk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:05:21 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/31] cuda : fp16 decode matvec and fused rms_norm prep for
 sm_60

Opt-in with GGML_CUDA_P60_MMVQ=1. Q4_K, Q5_K and Q8_0 matvec for GPUs
without dp4a, using half2 math. The fused RMS norm writes the fp16
activation layout so the matvecs skip a separate prep kernel.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
